OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order parade dispute
OL,4,Acontinues after main players hold talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters blocked the road at the
OL,7,Fweekend and after meeting the Northern
OL,8,FIreland secretary, a representative of
OL,9,Fthe road's residents said the Orange
OL,10,FOrder should focus on a different
OL,11,Froute.
OL,13,FThe Drumcree parade, which in the 1990s
OL,14,Fsparked some of the most serious
OL,15,Fdisorder in Northern Ireland's history,
OL,16,Fwas due to go ahead for the first time
OL,17,Fin 30 years after legal challenges.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
